{"id":"614236","name":"白萝卜肉馅小笼包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/614236/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面团","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"干面粉","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜洗净打丝。","img":"images/614236/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/614236/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"拌匀腌制一下。","img":"images/614236/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放清水洗一次，去掉萝卜的臭味。","img":"images/614236/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"萝卜丝和葱姜各剁成末。","img":"images/614236/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取肉糜，放食盐、鸡精、食用油及生抽老抽。","img":"images/614236/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放葱姜末拌匀。","img":"images/614236/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放萝卜。","img":"images/614236/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/614236/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取面团，揉光。","img":"images/614236/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分成比包饺子略大一点的剂子，擀皮。","img":"images/614236/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"包成小包子。","img":"images/614236/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"全部包好，放蒸笼里。","img":"images/614236/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放温暖处二次醒发。","img":"images/614236/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"发好的包子入蒸锅。","img":"images/614236/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"蒸好的包子。","img":"images/614236/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"丰盈的汁水让包子的味道很鲜美哦。","img":"images/614236/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"下次换锅盖或者换锅来蒸包子。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}